Endpoint returns the sentinel config.ErrNoEndpoint unwrapped, or the url.Parse error
under fmt.Errorf "config: endpoint: %w". url.Parse wraps everything in *url.Error, so
every stdlib entry (url.EscapeError, url.InvalidHostError, netip parse errors, opaque
errors.New ...) must end with the chain *net/url.Error.Unwrap -> fmt.Errorf
"config: endpoint: %w"; ErrNoEndpoint has no chain.
-- args --
config/config.go:@endpoint
